Source: the --grab-delay-ms argument of the CI-only probe scripts/ci/xres-owner.c, parsed by strtol (scripts/ci/xres-owner.c:869-873). Since this release the parser refuses a value below 0 or above MAX_GRAB_DELAY_MS = 60000 (scripts/ci/xres-owner.c:871-873), so delay_ms is at most 60000 and the expression GRAB_BOUND_SECONDS + (delay_ms + 999) / 1000 at the flagged alarm call (scripts/ci/xres-owner.c:981) is a small positive long that cannot overflow or wrap the unsigned cast; alarm(0) is unreachable. The workflows pass only --mode wm --owner-pid, and scripts/ is not published. Verdict: false-positive.
